flowchart LR
  accTitle: Mailcow to Stalwart to Vertex
  accDescr: The original Mailcow migration preserved native credentials. The subsequent Vertex migration froze the source writer, imported and verified the native data, rebuilt search and switched the public DNS. The old host remains for transition dependencies.
  A["Mailcow → Stalwart<br/>Native credentials + existing clients"] --> B["Freeze source writer<br/>Native export + import"]
  B --> C["Verify data + rebuild search<br/>Shared PostgreSQL + Redis"]:::core
  C --> D["Switch public DNS<br/>Three separate node frontends"]
  D --> E["Source writer stays fenced<br/>Retain transition dependencies"]

